      "created_at": "2019-12-23T10:52:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In My Hero Accadamia there is a villan attack at the disaster training center, some of the low grade, expendable bad guys could be 10s</p>\n<p>probably most of the card game targets with higher HP too. Voss might send a lot of D6 but some could be 10 or 12. And when an Orginization Underboss calls in \"the big guns\" to \"take care\" of a problem they would still be minions. Also most of the big scary cryptids would still only be minions</p>",
